 x="947.6" y="140" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#7c3aed" opacity="0.47"><title>Vicky, 10:00 UTC: 6</title></rect><text x="0" y="192" class="hl">Silvio</text><rect x="110.0" y="185" width="50.9" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="162.4" y="185" width="50.9" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="214.7" y="185" width="50.9" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="267.1" y="185" width="50.9" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="319.4" y="185" width="50.9" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="371.8" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.36"><title>Silvio Switha, 23:00 UTC: 3</title></rect><rect x="424.1" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 00:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="476.5" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.47"><title>Silvio Switha, 01:00 UTC: 6</title></rect><rect x="528.8" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 02:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="581.2" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.36"><title>Silvio Switha, 03:00 UTC: 3</title></rect><rect x="633.5" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.33"><title>Silvio Switha, 04:00 UTC: 2</title></rect><rect x="685.9" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.40"><title>Silvio Switha, 05:00 UTC: 4</title></rect><rect x="738.2" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.40"><title>Silvio Switha, 06:00 UTC: 4</title></rect><rect x="790.6" y="174" width="50.9" height="26" rx="3" fill="#b91c1c" opacity="0.29"><title>Silvio Switha, 07:00 UTC: 1</title></rect><rect x="842.9" y="185" width="50.9" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="895.3" y="185" width="50.9" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><rect x="947.6" y="185" width="50.9" height="4" rx="2" class="nil"/><text x="110.0" y="224" class="hx">04 Nov 18:00</text><text x="424.1" y="224" class="hx">05 Nov 00:00</text><text x="738.2" y="224" class="hx">05 Nov 06:00</text></svg><p class="cap">Each square is an hour; darker is more.</p></section><section class="slide" aria-label="The agents"><h2>53 agents did work today; 52 keys on the keys page</h2><div class="dotrow"><span>Dinis</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#111827" title="abp@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="conductor@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="dashboard@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="designer@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="dev@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="journalist@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="mentor@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="newsroom@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="observability@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="project-manager@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="pulse@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="security@web-summit.dinis"></i><i style="background:#111827" title="sgit@web-summit.dinis"></i></span><em>13: abp, conductor, dashboard, designer, dev, journalist, mentor, newsroom, observability, project-manager, pulse, security, sgit</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Indi</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#c2410c" title="accountant@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="builder@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="conductor@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="dashboard@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="designer@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="dev@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="factory@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="journalist@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="messaging@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="synthetic@web-summit.indi"></i><i style="background:#c2410c" title="ux@web-summit.indi"></i></span><em>11: accountant, builder, conductor, dashboard, designer, dev, factory, journalist, messaging, synthetic, ux</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Jose</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#0e7490" title="automation@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="conductor@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="dashboard@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="designer@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="dev@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="helper@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="vault@web-summit.jose"></i><i style="background:#0e7490" title="watcher@web-summit.jose"></i></span><em>8: automation, conductor, dashboard, designer, dev, helper, vault, watcher</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Angelo</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#15803d" title="conductor@web-summit.angelo"></i><i style="background:#15803d" title="dashboard@web-summit.angelo"></i><i style="background:#15803d" title="dev@web-summit.angelo"></i><i style="background:#15803d" title="helper@web-summit.angelo"></i><i style="background:#15803d" title="team-collaboration@web-summit.angelo"></i><i style="background:#15803d" title="vault@web-summit.angelo"></i></span><em>6: conductor, dashboard, dev, helper, team-collaboration, vault</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Vicky</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="conductor@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="curator@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="dashboard@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="dev@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="logistics@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="pm@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="programme@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="researcher@web-summit.vicky"></i><i style="background:#7c3aed" title="vault@web-summit.vicky"></i></span><em>9: conductor, curator, dashboard, dev, logistics, pm, programme, researcher, vault</em></div><div class="dotrow"><span>Silvio</span><span class="ds"><i style="background:#b91c1c" title="conductor@web-summit.silvio"></i><i style="background:#b91c1c" title="dev@web-summit.silvio"></i><i style="background:#b91c1c" title="outreach@web-summit.silvio"></i><i style="background:#b91c1c" title="procurement@web-summit.silvio"></i><i style="background:#b91c1c" title="vault@web-summit.silvio"></i><i style="background:#b91c1c" title="video@web-summit.silvio"></i></span><em>6: conductor, dev, outreach, procurement, vault, video</em></div><p class="cap">One dot per agent that committed under its own name since the last stand-up.</p></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Since yesterday 18:00"><h2>Since yesterday's 18:00: who moved what</h2><div class="bars"><div class="b"><span>Dinis</span><i style="width:100%;background:#111827"></i><b>98</b></div><div class="b"><span>Indi</span><i style="width:41%;background:#c2410c"></i><b>40</b></div><div class="b"><span>Jose</span><i style="width:38%;background:#0e7490"></i><b>37</b></div><div class="b"><span>Angelo</span><i style="width:36%;background:#15803d"></i><b>35</b></div><div class="b"><span>Vicky</span><i style="width:33%;background:#7c3aed"></i><b>32</b></div><div class="b"><span>Silvio</span><i style="width:26%;background:#b91c1c"></i><b>25</b></div></div><p class="cap">Commits since 18:00 yesterday, by person (their agents).</p><ul><li><b>Dinis</b>, through the night with his agents: the newsroom became <b>The Lisbon Wire</b>; the sticker vote; observability; his cockpit; the cards redesigned (design A)</li><li><b>Vicky</b>: the agenda released (209 items), the shortlist vault's read key sent to the conductor (WS-153), her side of the garments, cards and stickers done</li><li><b>Jose</b>: his watcher ran team-wide for the first time; n8n flows brought to 3.0 practice (WS-74); brief 8 put the vote first</li><li><b>Angelo</b>: a lane to his conductor, the signature rule (signed messages count for tiers 1 and 2), his command centre answers; the daily note (overdue 24 to 73)</li><li><b>Silvio</b>: four video storyboards, the stand loop's shot list, a 30-second film; WS-166, every key on every device; <b>the first sticker vote</b></li><li><b>Indi</b>: newsroom push access confirmed (WS-145), her patch live; WS-133 measured; in person today</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="The Lisbon Wire"><h2>The newsroom is now The Lisbon Wire</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-05-1300/nr-front.jpg" alt="web-summit.newsroom.sgit.ai: the front page" loading="lazy"><figcaption>web-summit.newsroom.sgit.ai: the front page</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-05-1300/nr-graph.jpg" alt="The graph: companies, sessions, people, places" loading="lazy"><figcaption>The graph: companies, sessions, people, places</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>109 company profiles</b>, the agenda by day, pages for events, people, organisations, topics and places; the data as JSON with an API</li><li>Search, an <b>Ask the newsroom</b> chat, a control centre with every run and agent, a reading meter</li><li><b>Unblocked this morning</b>: Vicky's programme and curator desks were held by the newsroom's gate; the release script now derives the data itself</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="The sticker vote"><h2>The sticker vote: closes 14:30 today</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-05-1300/ws-vote.jpg" alt="/stickers/vote/: rank your top 10" loading="lazy"><figcaption>/stickers/vote/: rank your top 10</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-05-1300/ws-home.jpg" alt="On the home page" loading="lazy"><figcaption>On the home page</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>Now:</b> stickers_vote: 2 pending in 2 lane(s); silvio: 1; angelo: 1</li><li><b>Everyone with a site key</b>: vote before 14:30; it tests the whole flow (key, sealed lane, signed ballot, drain)</li><li><b>Drainers</b>: Angelo, Jose, Indi, Dinis: /stickers/vote/vault/</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Observability and the cockpit"><h2>Observability, and Dinis's cockpit</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-05-1300/ws-obs.jpg" alt="/observability/: read from an encrypted vault in the browser" loading="lazy"><figcaption>/observability/: read from an encrypted vault in the browser</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-05-1300/ws-cockpit.jpg" alt="Dinis&#x27;s cockpit: decide in one click, signed" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Dinis&#x27;s cockpit: decide in one click, signed</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>Every agent logs its runs</b> (WS-160): 9 already do</li><li><b>The cockpit's first action</b> (WS-145, Indi's newsroom access) was drained, verified and done; Angelo's dashboard agent proposes it as his pattern</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="The cards"><h2>The cards: design A, ordered</h2><div class="two"><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-05-1300/ws-cards.jpg" alt="Three audiences: executives, GRC, security" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Three audiences: executives, GRC, security</figcaption></figure><figure class="shot"><img src="../../../assets/shows/2026-11-05-1300/ws-print.jpg" alt="/cards/print/: the order for ProntaPrint Chiswick" loading="lazy"><figcaption>/cards/print/: the order for ProntaPrint Chiswick</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><b>600 team cards with no names</b> (200 each colour), collection <b>Friday 6 November</b></li><li><b>Open:</b> personal cards too, or only these three? (Vicky: "whatever Dinis decides")</li></ul></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Keys"><h2>Keys: who can be known by the site</h2><div class="keys"><div class="k on" style="--c:#111827"><b>Dinis</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#b91c1c"><b>Silvio</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k " style="--c:#1d4ed8"><b>Nimay</b><span>no key yet</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#15803d"><b>Angelo</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#7c3aed"><b>Vicky</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#c2410c"><b>Indi</b><span>key issued</span></div><div class="k on" style="--c:#0e7490"><b>Jose</b><span>key issued</span></div></div><p class="cap">WS-166: every person's key on every phone and iPad before Monday. Nimay still has none.</p></section><section class="slide" aria-label="To decide now"><h2>To decide at this stand-up</h2><ol class="decide"><li><b>Personal business cards</b>: still printed, or only the three team cards?</li><li><b>Outreach</b>: 28 emails drafted in Silvio's Gmail wait for Dinis's yes on the claims</li><li><b>Jose's site and UI issues</b>: Angelo's and Dinis's dev agents own them, Jose reviews</li><li><b>The garments</b>: collection day, and who collects (Silvio)</li><li><b>WS-165</b>: one vault for the requests we receive, option A or B</li><li><b>Overdue: 73</b>, 100 of 143 open issues unowned: five minutes for owners to move their own dates</li></ol></section><section class="slide" aria-label="Follow-ups"><h2>Follow-ups, each with an owner</h2><ul><li><b>Everyone</b>: vote before 14:30; say what broke</li><li><b>Angelo, Jose, Indi</b>: one drain each after a few votes</li><li><b>Nimay</b>: accept the repository invitation (WS-09) and get a site key</li><li><b>Silvio</b>: unstick the dashboard step (L3 for more than a day)</li><li><b>Dinis's conductor</b>: record today's decisions with team-collaboration@angelo; the 18:00 deck</li></ul></section></div>
<script src="../../../assets/deck.js" defer></script>
